## Pi model modes

For the interactive main `openai-codex/gpt-5.6-sol` session, a user-selected
`max` reasoning level is allowed. The shared `xhigh` ceiling still applies to
dispatched lanes. Keep `ultra` disabled; Pi uses explicit native lanes for
multi-agent work.

Include `plannotator-url` output when opening Plannotator or grill review so another Tailscale device can open it.

## Native model orchestration

Outside the shared Grok effort and review rules, choose the agent prompt, model, and
reasoning effort independently. Do not map models permanently to roles such as
scout, architect, or coder.

`pi-kit` lanes require an explicit full model selector and effort per call.

Available managed pool:

